(5831177, 849655, 21124, '<td valign="top">Nice light, but it seems to me that the double reflection from the mirror is visible.<br/>If you want to only have a single reflection from the mirror, either use a front mirror (instead of the rear mirror you used) or simply use a polarizer filter in order to select only one of the two reflections.</td>', 'Nice light, but it seems to me that the double reflection from the mirror is visible.If you want to only have a single reflection from the mirror, either use a front mirror (instead of the rear mirror you used) or simply use a polarizer filter in order to select only one of the two reflections.', '2010-01-25 03:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
