(5832291, 849707, 28427, '<td valign="top">All "ingredients" such as the lighting, background, colour of the vase etc...go very well together. I only find it a shame that the pears are so small compared to the vase with flowers.</td>', 'All "ingredients" such as the lighting, background, colour of the vase etc...go very well together. I only find it a shame that the pears are so small compared to the vase with flowers.', '2010-01-25 12:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
