(5832500, 849533, 101668, '<td valign="top">Nice colour contrast but, and I am just suggesting, maybe a bit much of a muchness? I do like it though.</td>', 'Nice colour contrast but, and I am just suggesting, maybe a bit much of a muchness? I do like it though.', '2010-01-25 14:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832503, 849532, 70265, '<td valign="top">Yes! I''m really liking this one --- the simplicity, tones, composition, DOF, it all works for me. Good luck!!</td>', 'Yes! I''m really liking this one --- the simplicity, tones, composition, DOF, it all works for me. Good luck!!', '2010-01-25 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832504, 849645, 70265, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting</td>', 'Love the lighting', '2010-01-25 14:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832509, 849684, 70265, '<td valign="top">More pears ... they can photograph so well can''t they. This is interesting. What I like most are the muted tones, contrast of textures and reflection. Well done!</td>', 'More pears ... they can photograph so well can''t they. This is interesting. What I like most are the muted tones, contrast of textures and reflection. Well done!', '2010-01-25 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832511, 849711, 70265, '<td valign="top">Cute idea</td>', 'Cute idea', '2010-01-25 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832516, 849654, 70265, '<td valign="top">Has that Old Masters feel, nice!</td>', 'Has that Old Masters feel, nice!', '2010-01-25 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832522, 849505, 70265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful set-up.</td>', 'Beautiful set-up.', '2010-01-25 14:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832531, 849629, 70265, '<td valign="top">A teeny sharper focus would''ve put this to another level. As is, I do like the composition, tones &amp; your choice of subject matter and background. Good luck!</td>', 'A teeny sharper focus would''ve put this to another level. As is, I do like the composition, tones & your choice of subject matter and background. Good luck!', '2010-01-25 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832532, 847800, 101668, '<td valign="top">Clourful, traditional. Very good</td>', 'Clourful, traditional. Very good', '2010-01-25 14:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832533, 849715, 70265, '<td valign="top">Pretty!</td>', 'Pretty!', '2010-01-25 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832537, 849675, 70265, '<td valign="top">One of my favs in the challenge. I could see this hanging in my kitchen ... Maybe as a series?</td>', 'One of my favs in the challenge. I could see this hanging in my kitchen ... Maybe as a series?', '2010-01-25 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832543, 849504, 70265, '<td valign="top">A beautiful use of duotone. Wonderful lighting, comp &amp; detail. I''d pick this as Top 10 for sure.</td>', 'A beautiful use of duotone. Wonderful lighting, comp & detail. I''d pick this as Top 10 for sure.', '2010-01-25 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832554, 849068, 101668, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2010-01-25 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832564, 848871, 70265, '<td valign="top">This is great ... on so many levels ...  Interesting, unique, point of color, and the lighting is tres magnifique! Not sure if you''ll get marked down because some won''t consider it a still life ... but who cares ??</td>', 'This is great ... on so many levels ...  Interesting, unique, point of color, and the lighting is tres magnifique! Not sure if you''ll get marked down because some won''t consider it a still life ... but who cares ??', '2010-01-25 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832565, 849607, 70265, '<td valign="top">Nice Old Masters feel.</td>', 'Nice Old Masters feel.', '2010-01-25 14:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832568, 849396, 70265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Reminds me of a Silverfox.</td>', 'Beautiful. Reminds me of a Silverfox.', '2010-01-25 14:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832571, 849270, 66515, '<td valign="top">lol...never even thought anything like this would show up. Definitely made me laugh! :)</td>', 'lol...never even thought anything like this would show up. Definitely made me laugh! :)', '2010-01-25 14:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832577, 849566, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit on the dark side and some of the fruit is out of focus. Perhaps more depth of field is required?</td>', 'A bit on the dark side and some of the fruit is out of focus. Perhaps more depth of field is required?', '2010-01-25 14:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832581, 849158, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures. The ground seems rather dull and lacks some detail. I like the green leafy background.</td>', 'Interesting textures. The ground seems rather dull and lacks some detail. I like the green leafy background.', '2010-01-25 14:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832586, 849596, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I am really not sure about the frog. You have nice lighting and great colors and he kinda looks just tossed into the scene.</td>', 'Great shot but I am really not sure about the frog. You have nice lighting and great colors and he kinda looks just tossed into the scene.', '2010-01-25 14:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832593, 849700, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little tight on the top of the shot. The fruit in the back of the basket need a bit more light. It looks like this was illuminated with on camera flash. If you could get the flash off to the left and direct it inside the basket more it would help. <br/> <br/>The oranges are also quite shiny. I had similar problems with my image and I''m not sure how to cut down the glare.</td>', 'A little tight on the top of the shot. The fruit in the back of the basket need a bit more light. It looks like this was illuminated with on camera flash. If you could get the flash off to the left and direct it inside the basket more it would help.  The oranges are also quite shiny. I had similar problems with my image and I''m not sure how to cut down the glare.', '2010-01-25 14:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832601, 849548, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup. I''d like to see this with a bit more depth. This composition is quite two dimensional in my opinion. Good lighting and exposure. Nice subtle background</td>', 'Interesting setup. I''d like to see this with a bit more depth. This composition is quite two dimensional in my opinion. Good lighting and exposure. Nice subtle background', '2010-01-25 14:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832605, 849712, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting high key image. Creative take on the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting high key image. Creative take on the challenge.', '2010-01-25 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832608, 849325, 66515, '<td valign="top">Subtle joke :) <br/>The orange might need more diffused lighting and some fill in the front.</td>', 'Subtle joke :) The orange might need more diffused lighting and some fill in the front.', '2010-01-25 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832678, 848697, 98977, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  I also, feel like it DNMC....  But nice work setting this up and shooting it any way.</td>', 'I love this photo!  I also, feel like it DNMC....  But nice work setting this up and shooting it any way.', '2010-01-25 14:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832694, 848043, 113278, '<td valign="top">It is a little dark and I would like to see the specks on the background gone but overall I like the feel of this and I think it is well composed. 7</td>', 'It is a little dark and I would like to see the specks on the background gone but overall I like the feel of this and I think it is well composed. 7', '2010-01-25 15:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832725, 849500, 113278, '<td valign="top">I would like brighter colors but I think the pale colors here works well with the soft light so 7</td>', 'I would like brighter colors but I think the pale colors here works well with the soft light so 7', '2010-01-25 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5832736, 849678, 113278, '<td valign="top">The coros are beautiful and it is well lit and nice and sharp. I would like to see it cropped or composed differently though. I think that would make this truly outstanding. I would say 6.</td>', 'The coros are beautiful and it is well lit and nice and sharp. I would like to see it cropped or composed differently though. I think that would make this truly outstanding. I would say 6.', '2010-01-25 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
