(5834863, 849713, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very well done...one of my top picks.  I like what you''ve done with the tablecloth and your background.  Lighting may be just a tad hot; just enough to keep me from reaching for the 10 - a 9 will just have to do.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Very well done...one of my top picks.  I like what you''ve done with the tablecloth and your background.  Lighting may be just a tad hot; just enough to keep me from reaching for the 10 - a 9 will just have to do.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-26 15:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5834873, 848730, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice choice in B/W decision.  It really lets the textures speak.  Your lens choice is very sharp at ground zero (focal point)...front left apple is jumping off my screen!  :-)  A top pick for me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice choice in B/W decision.  It really lets the textures speak.  Your lens choice is very sharp at ground zero (focal point)...front left apple is jumping off my screen!  :-)  A top pick for me.  Good luck!', '2010-01-26 15:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
