(5840717, 849606, 51793, '<td valign="top">Your picture looks like it is oof and the lighting is off.</td>', 'Your picture looks like it is oof and the lighting is off.', '2010-01-28 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840719, 849134, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, but effective.  I like it!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, but effective.  I like it!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-28 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840720, 849146, 51793, '<td valign="top">This would have been just better without the grain and the photomatrix effect.</td>', 'This would have been just better without the grain and the photomatrix effect.', '2010-01-28 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840721, 849574, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice detail!</td>', 'Nice detail!', '2010-01-28 14:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840722, 849701, 51793, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the background really fits the image. Seems to be out of place.</td>', 'I don''t think the background really fits the image. Seems to be out of place.', '2010-01-28 14:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840723, 849721, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a unique perspective.  Nice use of props also.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a unique perspective.  Nice use of props also.  Well done!', '2010-01-28 14:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840724, 849596, 51793, '<td valign="top">A macro shot of this would have been neat to see.</td>', 'A macro shot of this would have been neat to see.', '2010-01-28 14:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840725, 849158, 51793, '<td valign="top">The lighting of the pears is off. I think the bottom is just too dark.</td>', 'The lighting of the pears is off. I think the bottom is just too dark.', '2010-01-28 14:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840726, 849534, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool effect you get with the reflections off the glass.  I really like what it does to the grapes on the far left.  Nicely done overall.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool effect you get with the reflections off the glass.  I really like what it does to the grapes on the far left.  Nicely done overall.  Good luck.', '2010-01-28 14:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840732, 849711, 51793, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a red glowing effect on the pie crust.</td>', 'Seems to be a red glowing effect on the pie crust.', '2010-01-28 14:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840902, 849532, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple, well lit.  Looks good from here!</td>', 'Clean, simple, well lit.  Looks good from here!', '2010-01-28 15:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840914, 849640, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy!  That knife really commands attention.  Not a bad thing, just saying...</td>', 'Looks yummy!  That knife really commands attention.  Not a bad thing, just saying...', '2010-01-28 15:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840917, 849644, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice arrrangement.  Lighting is a little flat.</td>', 'Nice arrrangement.  Lighting is a little flat.', '2010-01-28 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840925, 848726, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pleasing presentation.  Lighting is very good.  Could be a little heavy on post-processing.</td>', 'Pleasing presentation.  Lighting is very good.  Could be a little heavy on post-processing.', '2010-01-28 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840931, 849396, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet very effective.  Well done.</td>', 'Simple, yet very effective.  Well done.', '2010-01-28 16:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840940, 849612, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, your title actually works well with this photo.  I mean that in the sense of you can almost reach out and touch the fruit.  That is directly related to the lighting.  Certainly a switch from the classic, dimly lit still lifes that are dominant in this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s funny, your title actually works well with this photo.  I mean that in the sense of you can almost reach out and touch the fruit.  That is directly related to the lighting.  Certainly a switch from the classic, dimly lit still lifes that are dominant in this challenge.  Good luck.', '2010-01-28 16:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840945, 849645, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve isolated the lighting on the pear.  The bg prop works well too.  :-)</td>', 'I like the way you''ve isolated the lighting on the pear.  The bg prop works well too.  :-)', '2010-01-28 16:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840958, 849510, 30049, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This thing just jumps off the page!  Not sure if I like the backdrop material yet or not...it''s very busy.  Lighting could be diffused a little IMO - seems a little harsh.</td>', 'WOW!  This thing just jumps off the page!  Not sure if I like the backdrop material yet or not...it''s very busy.  Lighting could be diffused a little IMO - seems a little harsh.', '2010-01-28 16:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840959, 849548, 30049, '<td valign="top">Elegant!</td>', 'Elegant!', '2010-01-28 16:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840964, 849715, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this.  The green backdrop works well...wish I didn''t see the seam up front, but not a major nit.  Overall, well done.</td>', 'I like the colors in this.  The green backdrop works well...wish I didn''t see the seam up front, but not a major nit.  Overall, well done.', '2010-01-28 16:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840967, 849700, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice layout.  Lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Nice layout.  Lighting is a little harsh.', '2010-01-28 16:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5840974, 849246, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of items.  This photo has a soft, dreamy look that I think is partly due to noise reduction?  Everything seems TOO smooth IMO.  The wine bottle, while cute, is really standing out as kind of out of place.  Part of it is the blue doesn''t work with the warm colors of the reds and yellow.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice combination of items.  This photo has a soft, dreamy look that I think is partly due to noise reduction?  Everything seems TOO smooth IMO.  The wine bottle, while cute, is really standing out as kind of out of place.  Part of it is the blue doesn''t work with the warm colors of the reds and yellow.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-28 16:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841074, 849653, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly straight-forward and simple.  Lighting is "ok".  What''s hurting this is the front apple not being sharply focused like the other.</td>', 'Certainly straight-forward and simple.  Lighting is "ok".  What''s hurting this is the front apple not being sharply focused like the other.', '2010-01-28 16:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841076, 849600, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fine overall.  Seems more of a macro shot than a still life IMO.</td>', 'This is fine overall.  Seems more of a macro shot than a still life IMO.', '2010-01-28 16:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841090, 849174, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  A little bit underexposed.  Could use a smidge more DOF also.</td>', 'Cute.  A little bit underexposed.  Could use a smidge more DOF also.', '2010-01-28 16:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841091, 848512, 30049, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this looks so familiar.  Could swear I''ve seen this somewhere else.  Not saying that THIS photo was seen elsewhere, just the setup.  I may have ran across it while researching still life myself.  :-)  Anyway...this shot is done quite nicely with very balanced lighting and good use of materials.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know why this looks so familiar.  Could swear I''ve seen this somewhere else.  Not saying that THIS photo was seen elsewhere, just the setup.  I may have ran across it while researching still life myself.  :-)  Anyway...this shot is done quite nicely with very balanced lighting and good use of materials.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-28 16:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841095, 849502, 30049, '<td valign="top">This would make a nice stock photo.  Wish the bit of white showing on the bottom plate wasn''t visible...it''s throwing the symetry off a little.</td>', 'This would make a nice stock photo.  Wish the bit of white showing on the bottom plate wasn''t visible...it''s throwing the symetry off a little.', '2010-01-28 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841104, 849718, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm...a little ho-hummish IMO.</td>', 'Ummm...a little ho-hummish IMO.', '2010-01-28 16:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841115, 849684, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done here overall.  The lighting is right on the edge, being nearly too hot...borderline.  The reflection is a fun thing, although I''d like to see just a little less room on the bottom.</td>', 'I like what you''ve done here overall.  The lighting is right on the edge, being nearly too hot...borderline.  The reflection is a fun thing, although I''d like to see just a little less room on the bottom.', '2010-01-28 16:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841261, 849721, 86799, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle.  Takes away a lot of depth.</td>', 'Unusual angle.  Takes away a lot of depth.', '2010-01-28 18:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841266, 849111, 86799, '<td valign="top">The glass is falling slightly to the left.</td>', 'The glass is falling slightly to the left.', '2010-01-28 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841269, 849556, 86799, '<td valign="top">A bit too basic for interest, IMO.  Well exposed and sharp.</td>', 'A bit too basic for interest, IMO.  Well exposed and sharp.', '2010-01-28 18:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841272, 849543, 86799, '<td valign="top">Pretty harsh lighting.  Perspective skewed a bit...the bottle tilts right.</td>', 'Pretty harsh lighting.  Perspective skewed a bit...the bottle tilts right.', '2010-01-28 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841274, 849655, 86799, '<td valign="top">Looks good.</td>', 'Looks good.', '2010-01-28 18:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841277, 848332, 86799, '<td valign="top">Talk about natural fractals!  Editing is a bit obvious, but initial impact is strong.</td>', 'Talk about natural fractals!  Editing is a bit obvious, but initial impact is strong.', '2010-01-28 18:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841279, 849713, 86799, '<td valign="top">Bottle is off vertical to the left, and throws off the composition.</td>', 'Bottle is off vertical to the left, and throws off the composition.', '2010-01-28 18:20:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5841284, 849573, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment (of my favorite kind of pear) but just a little dark (on my monitor) for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting treatment (of my favorite kind of pear) but just a little dark (on my monitor) for my taste.', '2010-01-28 18:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841285, 849027, 86799, '<td valign="top">Lighting is pretty harsh...lots of blown highlights.</td>', 'Lighting is pretty harsh...lots of blown highlights.', '2010-01-28 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841289, 849612, 86799, '<td valign="top">Unusual structure, but effective.  Nice light and color.</td>', 'Unusual structure, but effective.  Nice light and color.', '2010-01-28 18:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841292, 848104, 86799, '<td valign="top">Very effective arrangement, nice "still life" feel to it.</td>', 'Very effective arrangement, nice "still life" feel to it.', '2010-01-28 18:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841294, 849492, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the lighting/contrast seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the lighting/contrast seems a bit harsh.', '2010-01-28 18:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841300, 849672, 86799, '<td valign="top">So nice, but would be better if the rim of the pot were more level.</td>', 'So nice, but would be better if the rim of the pot were more level.', '2010-01-28 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841311, 848281, 86799, '<td valign="top">Almost more abstract than still life...but I like it anyhow!  Mysterious and shapely.</td>', 'Almost more abstract than still life...but I like it anyhow!  Mysterious and shapely.', '2010-01-28 18:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841320, 849548, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented.  We invited?</td>', 'Nicely presented.  We invited?', '2010-01-28 18:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841330, 849502, 86799, '<td valign="top">More promotional than "still life" maybe, but very striking and attractive.  Eye candy.</td>', 'More promotional than "still life" maybe, but very striking and attractive.  Eye candy.', '2010-01-28 18:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841336, 849679, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, soft and smooth and "still life" flavored.</td>', 'Nicely done, soft and smooth and "still life" flavored.', '2010-01-28 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5841345, 849684, 86799, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective and the sculpture adds a lot.</td>', 'Simple but effective and the sculpture adds a lot.', '2010-01-28 18:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5842854, 849159, 113075, '<td valign="top">Excellent creative work!! 9</td>', 'Excellent creative work!! 9', '2010-01-29 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5842855, 849068, 113075, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work, compliments! 9!</td>', 'Wonderful work, compliments! 9!', '2010-01-29 08:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5842857, 849111, 113075, '<td valign="top">excellent colourful image - lovely presentation 9!</td>', 'excellent colourful image - lovely presentation 9!', '2010-01-29 08:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843336, 849714, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the texture feel to this, both the bg and the fruit itself.  A very minimalist type photo, but interesting nonetheless.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the texture feel to this, both the bg and the fruit itself.  A very minimalist type photo, but interesting nonetheless.  Well done.', '2010-01-29 12:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843337, 847800, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fruit picnic!  :-)  I wouldn''t have thought of the candles...that''s an interesting twist.  Lighting is "ok", close to be a little hot on the right side.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a fruit picnic!  :-)  I wouldn''t have thought of the candles...that''s an interesting twist.  Lighting is "ok", close to be a little hot on the right side.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-29 12:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843338, 849607, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition with some interesting props...just a little harsh on the lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice composition with some interesting props...just a little harsh on the lighting.  Good luck.', '2010-01-29 12:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843342, 849566, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice layout of fruit.  The tablecloth is a little overpowering.  I think.  Hmmm...not sure about that.  :-)  The dark grapes are getting somewhat lost in the bg.  Nice control on the lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice layout of fruit.  The tablecloth is a little overpowering.  I think.  Hmmm...not sure about that.  :-)  The dark grapes are getting somewhat lost in the bg.  Nice control on the lighting.  Good luck.', '2010-01-29 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843345, 849675, 30049, '<td valign="top">Heh.  I almost commented on the blue color cast, then I saw your title.  :-) Not sure why, but I keep getting drawn to the window grid part this is sharply in focus.  Bit of an attention stealer.  Little bit of haloing on the left pear...  Overall, this is interesting when you take it in as a whole unit.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Heh.  I almost commented on the blue color cast, then I saw your title.  :-) Not sure why, but I keep getting drawn to the window grid part this is sharply in focus.  Bit of an attention stealer.  Little bit of haloing on the left pear...  Overall, this is interesting when you take it in as a whole unit.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2010-01-29 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843348, 849585, 30049, '<td valign="top">After seeing all of the subdued lighting shots this almost hurts my eyes!  :-)  Overall, I like this shot.  You''re missing a lot of grapes on that stem.  Did you get hungry during the photo shoot?  :-D  Good luck!</td>', 'After seeing all of the subdued lighting shots this almost hurts my eyes!  :-)  Overall, I like this shot.  You''re missing a lot of grapes on that stem.  Did you get hungry during the photo shoot?  :-D  Good luck!', '2010-01-29 12:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843349, 849726, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thought is the shot was ruined by the plastic cup...the second thought is to smile at your humorous take.  :-)</td>', 'First thought is the shot was ruined by the plastic cup...the second thought is to smile at your humorous take.  :-)', '2010-01-29 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843351, 849504, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The pears in the bowl almost look bronzed with the color tone you''ve selected and the light sheen.  Kind of neat in a way.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow.  The pears in the bowl almost look bronzed with the color tone you''ve selected and the light sheen.  Kind of neat in a way.  Good luck!', '2010-01-29 12:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843367, 848192, 30049, '<td valign="top">Woah!  That baby sure jumps out at''cha!  Wish the top of the pear was a little sharper.  The blue in the lower left bg grabs some serious attention also.</td>', 'Woah!  That baby sure jumps out at''cha!  Wish the top of the pear was a little sharper.  The blue in the lower left bg grabs some serious attention also.', '2010-01-29 13:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843368, 849450, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is kinda fun.  Could almost have done this with just the single pear in the jar...  Something about the pear on the left seems strange; maybe it''s not having a stem, or that it''s a little soft (not in focal plane).  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is kinda fun.  Could almost have done this with just the single pear in the jar...  Something about the pear on the left seems strange; maybe it''s not having a stem, or that it''s a little soft (not in focal plane).  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-29 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843370, 849655, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very stock photo-ish.  Clean, simple.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very stock photo-ish.  Clean, simple.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.', '2010-01-29 13:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843372, 849029, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok composition (maybe lose the left glass), lighting is fair...image seems a bit noisy.</td>', 'Ok composition (maybe lose the left glass), lighting is fair...image seems a bit noisy.', '2010-01-29 13:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843373, 848170, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the pipe.  I want the front left pear to be in focus.  Shift everything left to avoid the seam on the right where the board runs out.  Nice colortones.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the pipe.  I want the front left pear to be in focus.  Shift everything left to avoid the seam on the right where the board runs out.  Nice colortones.  Good luck.', '2010-01-29 13:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843374, 849638, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure I really understand this one.  Seems like some stuff is missing, like you selected certain color ranges and pulled a desat slider.  The white spots on the bowl suggest that anyway.  Sorry, not a big fan of this presentation.  Good luck.</td>', 'Not sure I really understand this one.  Seems like some stuff is missing, like you selected certain color ranges and pulled a desat slider.  The white spots on the bowl suggest that anyway.  Sorry, not a big fan of this presentation.  Good luck.', '2010-01-29 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843376, 849533, 30049, '<td valign="top">The idea is fun for sure.  Background is fine.  The lighting is holding this back...it''s too flat.</td>', 'The idea is fun for sure.  Background is fine.  The lighting is holding this back...it''s too flat.', '2010-01-29 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843377, 849002, 30049, '<td valign="top">Line ''em up and take a pic...  Seems that the left side of this is more focused than the rest, and the item on the right looks like it''s rotting or has a fungus?  Sorry.  Doesn''t seem like too much thought went into this setup.</td>', 'Line ''em up and take a pic...  Seems that the left side of this is more focused than the rest, and the item on the right looks like it''s rotting or has a fungus?  Sorry.  Doesn''t seem like too much thought went into this setup.', '2010-01-29 13:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843379, 849111, 30049, '<td valign="top">Send this to Florida - someone out there can use this for a advertisement I''m sure!  :-)  Well done shot with stock photo written all over it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Send this to Florida - someone out there can use this for a advertisement I''m sure!  :-)  Well done shot with stock photo written all over it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2010-01-29 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843382, 849542, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That strawberry really gives some context to this shot.  The vase is much smaller than you''d think...or it''s a monster sized strawberry!!!  :-)  Photo is fine overall.  I like the comp.  Lighting is ok.  The image would be better presented with a smooth surface underneath...looks dirty on the lower-left, even though I think that''s probably just the material.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  That strawberry really gives some context to this shot.  The vase is much smaller than you''d think...or it''s a monster sized strawberry!!!  :-)  Photo is fine overall.  I like the comp.  Lighting is ok.  The image would be better presented with a smooth surface underneath...looks dirty on the lower-left, even though I think that''s probably just the material.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-29 13:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843383, 849665, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of those "what is it?" kind of shots...I can''t tell what the pear is sitting on.  Interesting.  The pear itself seems like it was selectively sharpened and as a result comes across a little oversharpened.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of those "what is it?" kind of shots...I can''t tell what the pear is sitting on.  Interesting.  The pear itself seems like it was selectively sharpened and as a result comes across a little oversharpened.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-29 13:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843389, 849654, 43774, '<td valign="top">A little bit dark in places but a lovely setup.</td>', 'A little bit dark in places but a lovely setup.', '2010-01-29 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843390, 849714, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the background and the lighting.</td>', 'I like the background and the lighting.', '2010-01-29 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843391, 849665, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear, nice colours.</td>', 'Very sharp and clear, nice colours.', '2010-01-29 13:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843392, 849574, 43774, '<td valign="top">Simple and perfect, excellent lighting.</td>', 'Simple and perfect, excellent lighting.', '2010-01-29 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843393, 849512, 43774, '<td valign="top">A nice setup, a bit dark in places.</td>', 'A nice setup, a bit dark in places.', '2010-01-29 13:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843394, 848104, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely setup, classic.</td>', 'Lovely setup, classic.', '2010-01-29 13:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843396, 849583, 43774, '<td valign="top">Bear! Very nice light, cute setup.</td>', 'Bear! Very nice light, cute setup.', '2010-01-29 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843397, 847840, 43774, '<td valign="top">How odd yet beautiful!</td>', 'How odd yet beautiful!', '2010-01-29 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843398, 849688, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the fruit, would like a bit more light elsewhere, especially around the bottom of the fruit. Nice.</td>', 'Nice light on the fruit, would like a bit more light elsewhere, especially around the bottom of the fruit. Nice.', '2010-01-29 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843399, 849655, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clean photo, great lighting.</td>', 'Very clean photo, great lighting.', '2010-01-29 13:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843400, 849653, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2010-01-29 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843401, 849540, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice backlighting.</td>', 'Very nice backlighting.', '2010-01-29 13:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843402, 849593, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle reflection, good lighting.</td>', 'I like the subtle reflection, good lighting.', '2010-01-29 13:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
