(5844907, 849158, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- good colors.  Perhaps it is an illusion due to their stronger pattern or perhaps my eyes are going bad, but it seems that the green leafy stuff in the BG is in better focus than the pears (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- good colors.  Perhaps it is an illusion due to their stronger pattern or perhaps my eyes are going bad, but it seems that the green leafy stuff in the BG is in better focus than the pears (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844911, 849679, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- but would have preferred a more interesting bowl (and that pear looks like is has been doing battle with something else) (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- but would have preferred a more interesting bowl (and that pear looks like is has been doing battle with something else) (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844915, 849664, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice transillumination look, although is appears a bit spooky (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice transillumination look, although is appears a bit spooky (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844916, 849644, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- but perhaps a bit busy (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- but perhaps a bit busy (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844921, 849709, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- even though there are a lot of fruit, the structure to their arrangement is good.  Not super fond of the bg however; perhaps a more plain and uniformly brown might have worked better. (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- even though there are a lot of fruit, the structure to their arrangement is good.  Not super fond of the bg however; perhaps a more plain and uniformly brown might have worked better. (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844922, 849478, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- interesting textures and patterns (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- interesting textures and patterns (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844924, 849529, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- well, actually, still life with fruit peels.  But it works for me -- nice parallel spirals, great colors, high originality. (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- well, actually, still life with fruit peels.  But it works for me -- nice parallel spirals, great colors, high originality. (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844925, 849068, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- handsome looking pears and reflections but could use a little extra something. (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- handsome looking pears and reflections but could use a little extra something. (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844926, 849598, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice pears, but could have used a little something extra (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice pears, but could have used a little something extra (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844928, 849583, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- I like the idea of going outside, but not sure the elements totally go together (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- I like the idea of going outside, but not sure the elements totally go together (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844930, 849503, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice bright colors (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice bright colors (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844932, 849002, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- but would like to see some sort of relationship or interaction between the three (although I will freely admit I could be missing it) (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- but would like to see some sort of relationship or interaction between the three (although I will freely admit I could be missing it) (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844934, 849628, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- simple but effective, nice reds (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- simple but effective, nice reds (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844935, 848065, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- fits the title well.  FWIW, cloth seems to be arranged a bit messily (not that I am a neat freak or anything) (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- fits the title well.  FWIW, cloth seems to be arranged a bit messily (not that I am a neat freak or anything) (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844939, 849715, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice yellow/orange/green colors of the fruit and flowers (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice yellow/orange/green colors of the fruit and flowers (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844940, 849217, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- although it could be argued that the fruit plays too minor a role here (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- although it could be argued that the fruit plays too minor a role here (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844942, 849537, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- although it looks like your banana did battle with the pears (or at least a little bit) (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- although it looks like your banana did battle with the pears (or at least a little bit) (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844943, 849551, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- personally I would have preferred a) bananas that don''t look like they are ready for the grave and b) pinapples that were not beheaded. (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- personally I would have preferred a) bananas that don''t look like they are ready for the grave and b) pinapples that were not beheaded. (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844944, 848157, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- simple yet very effective, nice originality, great red color (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- simple yet very effective, nice originality, great red color (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844945, 849558, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image --pretty combo of pears, tulips and lace (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image --pretty combo of pears, tulips and lace (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844946, 849710, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- but those red-tipped bananas are getting me thinking in the wrong direction (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- but those red-tipped bananas are getting me thinking in the wrong direction (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844948, 849702, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice colors and textures.  In view of the rocks being out of focus, I wonder if a bit of a crop off the bottom would be useful. (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice colors and textures.  In view of the rocks being out of focus, I wonder if a bit of a crop off the bottom would be useful. (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844952, 848771, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- interesting idea but I would have liked to either see more of the fruit or have an even closer up view (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- interesting idea but I would have liked to either see more of the fruit or have an even closer up view (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844954, 849685, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- solid image but line at junction of table and background is a bit distracting (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- solid image but line at junction of table and background is a bit distracting (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844956, 849566, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nicely arranged, nice cloth, but perhaps a bit underlit (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nicely arranged, nice cloth, but perhaps a bit underlit (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 21:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844957, 849027, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of fruit overall (not sure about the item in the back left).  The bowl and table work well together.  Lighting seems a little strong/harsh.</td>', 'I like the arrangement of fruit overall (not sure about the item in the back left).  The bowl and table work well together.  Lighting seems a little strong/harsh.', '2010-01-30 21:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844963, 849484, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is bright, fun, and interesting.  I like the bucket and sprig of green.  The purple backdrop is "ok" - I''m undecided if it''s helpful or not.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow!  This is bright, fun, and interesting.  I like the bucket and sprig of green.  The purple backdrop is "ok" - I''m undecided if it''s helpful or not.  Good luck.', '2010-01-30 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844967, 849570, 30049, '<td valign="top">Something about this seems off a little.  I think it''s soft, especially in the front center, and there appears to be some noise.  I wouldn''t give up on this concept as I think it has potential.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Something about this seems off a little.  I think it''s soft, especially in the front center, and there appears to be some noise.  I wouldn''t give up on this concept as I think it has potential.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-30 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844969, 849158, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is different.  Very good detail on the pears, especially the right one.  While I think being different, or out-of-the-box, is good at times, I''m just not sure that gets the same impact with the greens as it would with more traditional props.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'This is different.  Very good detail on the pears, especially the right one.  While I think being different, or out-of-the-box, is good at times, I''m just not sure that gets the same impact with the greens as it would with more traditional props.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-30 22:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844972, 849603, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Different.  Doesn''t that speck in the middle drive you crazy?!  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting.  Different.  Doesn''t that speck in the middle drive you crazy?!  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-30 22:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844974, 849628, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fresh and fun.  I like it.</td>', 'This is fresh and fun.  I like it.', '2010-01-30 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844975, 849600, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- great colors.  The only thing is that I wonder whether the voters will think this is more of a macro entry than a still life with fruit entry.  (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- great colors.  The only thing is that I wonder whether the voters will think this is more of a macro entry than a still life with fruit entry.  (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844976, 849573, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image - nice arrangement, great processing (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image - nice arrangement, great processing (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844978, 849678, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- colors are a bit too bright/saturated for my taste (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- colors are a bit too bright/saturated for my taste (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844980, 849671, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple and overall an "ok" presentation.  Silly perhaps, but one of the things that jumped out at me when I first saw this photo is that the bottle seems to be tilting right.  Angle of the camera maybe?  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple and overall an "ok" presentation.  Silly perhaps, but one of the things that jumped out at me when I first saw this photo is that the bottle seems to be tilting right.  Angle of the camera maybe?  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-30 22:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844981, 849533, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice variant of the co-mingled sliced up fruit shot (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice variant of the co-mingled sliced up fruit shot (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844983, 849556, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok", and I can appreciate simple sometimes, but this isn''t really doing anything for me.  Sorry.  I have no idea what the title means.  ???  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s "ok", and I can appreciate simple sometimes, but this isn''t really doing anything for me.  Sorry.  I have no idea what the title means.  ???  Good luck.', '2010-01-30 22:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844984, 849540, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- great colors and details.  The only thing is that I wonder whether the voters will think this is more of a macro entry than a still life with fruit entry.  (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- great colors and details.  The only thing is that I wonder whether the voters will think this is more of a macro entry than a still life with fruit entry.  (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844986, 849496, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- great colors and patterns.  The only thing is that I wonder whether the voters will think this is more of a macro entry than a still life with fruit entry.  (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- great colors and patterns.  The only thing is that I wonder whether the voters will think this is more of a macro entry than a still life with fruit entry.  (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844987, 849593, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and well focused.  Good job keeping the glass mostly clean.  Would be curious to see how this looks with maybe a little tighter crop.</td>', 'Nice detail and well focused.  Good job keeping the glass mostly clean.  Would be curious to see how this looks with maybe a little tighter crop.', '2010-01-30 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844988, 849502, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- excellent modern looking desing, nice rich orange colors (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- excellent modern looking desing, nice rich orange colors (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844989, 848862, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice layout overall.  Lighting could use some attention (it''s a little harsh), and the DOF should have been deeper to get the back fruit in focus.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice layout overall.  Lighting could use some attention (it''s a little harsh), and the DOF should have been deeper to get the back fruit in focus.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-30 22:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844990, 849535, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice details, except the orange up front is a bit out of focus and you might have been better off without it.  (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice details, except the orange up front is a bit out of focus and you might have been better off without it.  (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844991, 849570, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- great reflection, nice complementary colors (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- great reflection, nice complementary colors (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844992, 849517, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute concept.  Not sure that the grey bg works as well as black or true white could have.  Considering that this is running under advanced editing the lines on the area near the apple could have been cleaned up, as well as the dark spot on the front.  Nits?  Yep.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute concept.  Not sure that the grey bg works as well as black or true white could have.  Considering that this is running under advanced editing the lines on the area near the apple could have been cleaned up, as well as the dark spot on the front.  Nits?  Yep.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-30 22:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844993, 849639, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- I like the concept/originality and the frog but the colors seem a bit washed out for my taste (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- I like the concept/originality and the frog but the colors seem a bit washed out for my taste (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844994, 849008, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- nice colors.  A nitpicky comment is that the orange is not oriented precisely the same as the other two fruit. (Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- nice colors.  A nitpicky comment is that the orange is not oriented precisely the same as the other two fruit. (Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5844996, 849484, 82749, '<td valign="top">Nice fruit, nice image -- I like the bright colors of the lemons and limes but I think the brightness of the other elements distracts from the fruit(Comment only, no vote)</td>', 'Nice fruit, nice image -- I like the bright colors of the lemons and limes but I think the brightness of the other elements distracts from the fruit(Comment only, no vote)', '2010-01-30 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845063, 849724, 30049, '<td valign="top">I guess you were trying to go with a simpler approach?  I like the scarred wood.  Don''t care for the greyish background in the upper third.  Lighting is a little harsh also.</td>', 'I guess you were trying to go with a simpler approach?  I like the scarred wood.  Don''t care for the greyish background in the upper third.  Lighting is a little harsh also.', '2010-01-30 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845065, 849632, 30049, '<td valign="top">I want to like this.  The colors are great (bg mustard) and the cloth used has a fantastic pattern.  The main front pear seems quite soft and not nearly as focused as the one to the right.</td>', 'I want to like this.  The colors are great (bg mustard) and the cloth used has a fantastic pattern.  The main front pear seems quite soft and not nearly as focused as the one to the right.', '2010-01-31 00:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845068, 848557, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I''d prefer to see some real fruit in there...but still, it''s fun.  Good luck!</td>', 'Cute.  I''d prefer to see some real fruit in there...but still, it''s fun.  Good luck!', '2010-01-31 00:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845072, 849583, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s different, that''s for sure.  :-)  Compositionally it''s fine.  Pears on the lower ROT point, a slice of sky in the upper third, some hard working diagonals...lighting may be a little strong creating some harsh shadows.  Overall, quite interesting and fun.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, it''s different, that''s for sure.  :-)  Compositionally it''s fine.  Pears on the lower ROT point, a slice of sky in the upper third, some hard working diagonals...lighting may be a little strong creating some harsh shadows.  Overall, quite interesting and fun.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845075, 849641, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kinda knew we''d have to see this shot.  A cliche shot certainly, but you pulled it off quite well.  Good luck!  :-)</td>', 'Kinda knew we''d have to see this shot.  A cliche shot certainly, but you pulled it off quite well.  Good luck!  :-)', '2010-01-31 00:05:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5845077, 849581, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the pears and their positioning.  Cute title to match.  What the heck is that in the upper-right?!</td>', 'I like the pears and their positioning.  Cute title to match.  What the heck is that in the upper-right?!', '2010-01-31 00:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845080, 849649, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice comp with interesting props.  The reds are blown out and the lighting is a little strong (hot).  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice comp with interesting props.  The reds are blown out and the lighting is a little strong (hot).  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-31 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845082, 849598, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and lighting.  Simple, yet not boring.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice texture and lighting.  Simple, yet not boring.  Good luck!', '2010-01-31 00:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845086, 848762, 30049, '<td valign="top">The metal object is overbearing in comparison to the fruit.  White balance is on the warm side.  Fruit could be better focused, and a levels adjustment would help some also.  Just some quick observations, and obviously just one person''s opinion.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The metal object is overbearing in comparison to the fruit.  White balance is on the warm side.  Fruit could be better focused, and a levels adjustment would help some also.  Just some quick observations, and obviously just one person''s opinion.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845088, 849711, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  :-)  Dang, those apples look very smooth and waxy.  Did you give this a healthy shot of noise reduction, or are those apples just that clean and shiny?  BTW - fun title.</td>', 'Cute.  :-)  Dang, those apples look very smooth and waxy.  Did you give this a healthy shot of noise reduction, or are those apples just that clean and shiny?  BTW - fun title.', '2010-01-31 00:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845089, 849492, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the props and materials used.  Could use a better DOF to put all the fruit in the focal range.</td>', 'I like the props and materials used.  Could use a better DOF to put all the fruit in the focal range.', '2010-01-31 00:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845090, 849543, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok props and arrangement.  Photo seems to be tilting to the right?</td>', 'Ok props and arrangement.  Photo seems to be tilting to the right?', '2010-01-31 00:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845092, 849503, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the thought behind this idea.  Probably could have zeroed in a little tighter...a deeper aperture to maximize DOF would help a little also.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the thought behind this idea.  Probably could have zeroed in a little tighter...a deeper aperture to maximize DOF would help a little also.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845094, 849679, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is very well balanced with nice overall lighting and layout.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is very well balanced with nice overall lighting and layout.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845095, 848065, 30049, '<td valign="top">The comp is "ok".  Lighting overall is good.  Something doesn''t quite feel right as to balance.  The violin seems like it was just stuck in the back and is a little out of place.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The comp is "ok".  Lighting overall is good.  Something doesn''t quite feel right as to balance.  The violin seems like it was just stuck in the back and is a little out of place.  JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845096, 849702, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok layout.  There''s just no sparkle or wow to the fruit.  Something either in the lighting or in post-processing really flattened this out.  Just making some observations.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok layout.  There''s just no sparkle or wow to the fruit.  Something either in the lighting or in post-processing really flattened this out.  Just making some observations.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-31 00:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845098, 849537, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok comp - maybe a bit crowded.  Lighting is fine, although the white balance seems to be on the warm side.</td>', 'Ok comp - maybe a bit crowded.  Lighting is fine, although the white balance seems to be on the warm side.', '2010-01-31 00:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845099, 849558, 30049, '<td valign="top">Classy and elegant layout with good use of props.  Lighting, focus, and exposure are all in good shape.  Overall quite nice (you know you can clone out those specks in advanced editing right?).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Classy and elegant layout with good use of props.  Lighting, focus, and exposure are all in good shape.  Overall quite nice (you know you can clone out those specks in advanced editing right?).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845103, 849712, 30049, '<td valign="top">Different.  Kinda fun and unique for sure.  I''m seeing some shadows and edging in this with a distinct rectangle around the orange area...like some canvas was added perhaps?</td>', 'Different.  Kinda fun and unique for sure.  I''m seeing some shadows and edging in this with a distinct rectangle around the orange area...like some canvas was added perhaps?', '2010-01-31 00:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845104, 849727, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice simple presentation.  However, everything looks to be plastic.  Is it?</td>', 'Nice simple presentation.  However, everything looks to be plastic.  Is it?', '2010-01-31 00:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845106, 849008, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the angle.  That adds some dynamic to this...wouldn''t have worked as well vertically.  Your bg material choice is taking a little away from the overall presentation IMO.</td>', 'I like the angle.  That adds some dynamic to this...wouldn''t have worked as well vertically.  Your bg material choice is taking a little away from the overall presentation IMO.', '2010-01-31 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845107, 847840, 30049, '<td valign="top">The colors work well, and the idea is fun and unique.  May have been stronger with a different bg.  Lighting is on the edge of being too strong...not quite (on this monitor) for me, but others with different monitors???  Just a couple observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The colors work well, and the idea is fun and unique.  May have been stronger with a different bg.  Lighting is on the edge of being too strong...not quite (on this monitor) for me, but others with different monitors???  Just a couple observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-31 00:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845108, 849681, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation with the various props (I like the clock).  I can understand taking the soft dreamy approach. Looks a bit noisy however.  Big blowout and loss of detail in front of the lower right dish.</td>', 'Nice presentation with the various props (I like the clock).  I can understand taking the soft dreamy approach. Looks a bit noisy however.  Big blowout and loss of detail in front of the lower right dish.', '2010-01-31 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845110, 849182, 30049, '<td valign="top">Little bit busy with all of the stuff in your composition.  Lighting seems flat (little highlights and shadows to create interest and "pop").</td>', 'Little bit busy with all of the stuff in your composition.  Lighting seems flat (little highlights and shadows to create interest and "pop").', '2010-01-31 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845111, 849678, 30049, '<td valign="top">Did you put fake fruit in front of us?  :-)  I like the various wicker baskets.  Your lighting on this is too balanced and strong IMO.</td>', 'Did you put fake fruit in front of us?  :-)  I like the various wicker baskets.  Your lighting on this is too balanced and strong IMO.', '2010-01-31 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845112, 849325, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun play on words.  Would make a great stock photo.  Good luck!</td>', 'Fun play on words.  Would make a great stock photo.  Good luck!', '2010-01-31 00:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845114, 849512, 30049, '<td valign="top">Smidgen busy...losing impact you could get with detail because the area of coverage is so wide.  Look to be tilting to the left somewhat also.</td>', 'Smidgen busy...losing impact you could get with detail because the area of coverage is so wide.  Look to be tilting to the left somewhat also.', '2010-01-31 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845115, 848332, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool details in the green.  Good combo with the red.  May be a little ho-humish overall.</td>', 'Very cool details in the green.  Good combo with the red.  May be a little ho-humish overall.', '2010-01-31 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
