(5845756, 849606, 10785, '<td valign="top">Grat colors and lighting... all even except the one little spot of light. Beautiful colors. It looks a tad blurry or maybe the focus is a hair off. Otherwise it is a great classic style still life.</td>', 'Grat colors and lighting... all even except the one little spot of light. Beautiful colors. It looks a tad blurry or maybe the focus is a hair off. Otherwise it is a great classic style still life.', '2010-01-31 21:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
