(5845761, 849396, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lovely classic example.  I really like the muted tones.</td>', 'Lovely classic example.  I really like the muted tones.', '2010-01-31 21:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845765, 849529, 30049, '<td valign="top">I know this is unique and all, but it''s not really doing much for me.  Nothing personal...just my first reaction.  On a technical perspective, everything is well focused, lighting is a little strong, and the comp is a smidge tight on the left and bottom right.  Good luck.</td>', 'I know this is unique and all, but it''s not really doing much for me.  Nothing personal...just my first reaction.  On a technical perspective, everything is well focused, lighting is a little strong, and the comp is a smidge tight on the left and bottom right.  Good luck.', '2010-01-31 21:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5845766, 849654, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the thought that you put into this arrangement. I''m curious tho about the two strawberries and their location.  Great use of the soft and subtle light.</td>', 'I love the thought that you put into this arrangement. I''m curious tho about the two strawberries and their location.  Great use of the soft and subtle light.', '2010-01-31 21:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
