(5845777, 849588, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good idea putting the white border around this to set it apart from the DPC voting page.  The subject is a little ho-humish for me.  The net is cool in some respects, but it also takes away with the oof areas front and back.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Good idea putting the white border around this to set it apart from the DPC voting page.  The subject is a little ho-humish for me.  The net is cool in some respects, but it also takes away with the oof areas front and back.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck.', '2010-01-31 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
