(5845785, 849707, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the muted background and the vase with the flowers. It''s such a pretty combo.  I don''t get the sense tho that the pears belong in the scene.  They just seem out of place.</td>', 'I love the muted background and the vase with the flowers. It''s such a pretty combo.  I don''t get the sense tho that the pears belong in the scene.  They just seem out of place.', '2010-01-31 21:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
