(5848978, 849450, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very cool set up, nice light and colors, and I''m happy to have been one of your high votes.  Kudos for originality!  It''s a bit strange having one piece of fruit out of focus, though it''s good that the background is blurred.  Nitpicking, I might rotate the photo ever-so-slightly to the left as there seems to be a tilt.  I love the look of the jar and what the glass does to the pear inside.</td>', 'Very cool set up, nice light and colors, and I''m happy to have been one of your high votes.  Kudos for originality!  It''s a bit strange having one piece of fruit out of focus, though it''s good that the background is blurred.  Nitpicking, I might rotate the photo ever-so-slightly to the left as there seems to be a tilt.  I love the look of the jar and what the glass does to the pear inside.', '2010-02-02 12:05:31.000000', NULL, 0),
